{"id":1538,"date":"2015-08-20T05:00:29","date_gmt":"2015-08-20T12:00:29","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/?p=1538"},"modified":"2015-08-20T05:00:29","modified_gmt":"2015-08-20T12:00:29","slug":"call-for-presenters-at-pacificon-2015","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2015\/08\/20\/call-for-presenters-at-pacificon-2015\/","title":{"rendered":"Call For Presenters at Pacificon 2015"},"content":{"rendered":"<table width=\"385\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"100%\">\n<table width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Dear<\/strong><strong> Friends<\/strong><strong>,<\/strong><br \/>\n<strong>Pacificon 2015 is continuing with our annual Call For Presenters. \u00a0<\/strong><strong>Pacificon is known for its great Forums, and we&#8217;re looking for people to make that happen again in 2015 at the San Ramon Marriott located in San Ramon, California. \u00a0Your presentation should be designed to fit into a one hour timeslot and can be on any topic related to amateur radio: Operating, Contesting, DX, QRP, Homebrew, etc. \u00a0We are also looking for presentations on modern techniques such as Software Defined Radio, embedded controllers, small form-factor PCs, and digital modes. \u00a0We will provide the projector and microphone &#8211; you provide a laptop for display and your ideas. \u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>Please submit your presentation proposal by using the <a href=\"http:\/\/r20.rs6.net\/tn.jsp?f=001riSQwdZmJGeI-AozqqVsem_uzn6Y1sgJeVnJaNm1M4wiZyb6JHz3sXBOMhFnGDw_JXCLw4Usq2AyawYASL_z1cJnHCrhs9ALdyp_wrbkOvHMS9TLV5-I9bDuOm_ec_TKxC0ohZL9KO-wEfh4LzmrAigviqKuShswvZSb_mNwmzvbaPPPfPf8plPbWX6szcgo-NHvD-XlpvbQ11oBMPOnRUXk3djQEgx4pJbd30Rr-5M_DCRnppy7q4IBjGyFKoB0M055O6uNM3uzd7usVnFVw4GhC34o4MSMirJJojtBL9U=&amp;c=Q1fY23G3pPKVnFIIIe6CNoDjVuV3XnUPFS_D37axlUHftuAv1yRG8Q==&amp;ch=pE46mWOv4AJPUABjJGbcKf88M4obTkTp8dDfni-OZY2HpTSB5yGffQ==\">registration link<\/a> below\u00a0&#8211; there&#8217;s no charge to submit a proposal, but you must register to be considered. \u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>If selected as a presenter, your general admission badge ($25.00) to Pacificon 2015 will be provided at no-charge. \u00a0During the presentation proposal submission you will have an opportunity to purchase tickets for your family, friends, and to purchase additional add-ons such as the Antenna Seminar, Breakfast with Gordon West, the Saturday Dinner Banquet, etc.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>Be a part of something great at Pacificon 2015 &#8211; Submit your proposal today!<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"100%\">\n<table width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><em><strong><a href=\"http:\/\/r20.rs6.net\/tn.jsp?f=001riSQwdZmJGeI-AozqqVsem_uzn6Y1sgJeVnJaNm1M4wiZyb6JHz3sXBOMhFnGDw_iiCGRlGBBm-TXap5Qb-a-zYGXrrxYRgoS0Uj1VsLdg4qL80MCo0PTDzdeZh7HcwUlAFkWxJRita4_a8x8--pDJ7t-bsJx2kous_S4YlHEuc5KtkVi3vBpm15wtZ_0GB7MVhXR-A63CXe16O3fl1DGdIVEJ_0auj5pShnPLWimtGLpPSOeSlEsBIxO_LL0M-89LnFkcdEJLh_KzgCtIJtXg==&amp;c=Q1fY23G3pPKVnFIIIe6CNoDjVuV3XnUPFS_D37axlUHftuAv1yRG8Q==&amp;ch=pE46mWOv4AJPUABjJGbcKf88M4obTkTp8dDfni-OZY2HpTSB5yGffQ==\">Register Now as a Forum Speaker!<\/a><\/strong><\/em><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><a href=\"http:\/\/r20.rs6.net\/tn.jsp?f=001riSQwdZmJGeI-AozqqVsem_uzn6Y1sgJeVnJaNm1M4wiZyb6JHz3sT5YPBgixTGe54tDLuCeFlpMNsaAOtz7AvBaOqQoWxI8-pQJK2beR8if5ZKKqvcByhkJWJ2LNaKX9A2lBSlBYfHD_DWGwc5llrArOWf3lzJU3WbLxXGJkWcak1UvpGrrRg==&amp;c=Q1fY23G3pPKVnFIIIe6CNoDjVuV3XnUPFS_D37axlUHftuAv1yRG8Q==&amp;ch=pE46mWOv4AJPUABjJGbcKf88M4obTkTp8dDfni-OZY2HpTSB5yGffQ==\">CLICK HERE FOR PACIFICON 2015<\/a><\/strong><strong><a href=\"http:\/\/r20.rs6.net\/tn.jsp?f=001riSQwdZmJGeI-AozqqVsem_uzn6Y1sgJeVnJaNm1M4wiZyb6JHz3sT5YPBgixTGe54tDLuCeFlpMNsaAOtz7AvBaOqQoWxI8-pQJK2beR8if5ZKKqvcByhkJWJ2LNaKX9A2lBSlBYfHD_DWGwc5llrArOWf3lzJU3WbLxXGJkWcak1UvpGrrRg==&amp;c=Q1fY23G3pPKVnFIIIe6CNoDjVuV3XnUPFS_D37axlUHftuAv1yRG8Q==&amp;ch=pE46mWOv4AJPUABjJGbcKf88M4obTkTp8dDfni-OZY2HpT